      "text": "🚨 1. Reliability (MOST IMPORTANT REASON)\n\nWebhook flow:\n\nTreezor → HTTP webhook → your backend\n\nIf process immediately:\n\n❌ DB down → webhook fails\n❌ service crash → event lost\n❌ slow processing → timeout → retries from Treezor → duplicates\n\n---\n\n⚙️ 2. Fan-out (multiple internal systems)\n\nOne Treezor event must feed multiple systems:\n\nledger-service (money truth)\nfraud detection\nnotifications\nanalytics\nreconciliation\n\n👉 Without Kafka:\n\nwebhook must call all services ❌ (bad coupling)\n\n👉 With Kafka:\n\npublish once\nmany consumers independently react\n\n---\n\n🧠 3. Buffering / load protection\n\nPayments are bursty (lunch time spikes, etc.)\n\nKafka acts as:\n\n👉 a shock absorber\n\nIf:\n\n10k events arrive in 1 sec\n\nKafka:\n\nstores them safely\nconsumers process at their own pace\n\n---\n\n🔁 4. Retry + replay (critical in fintech)\n\nIf ledger-service bug happens:\n\n👉 Can replay Kafka topic\n\nWithout Kafka:\n\nNeed to re-hit Treezor APIs (often impossible)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🚨 1. Reliability (MOST IMPORTANT REASON)\n\nWebhook flow:\n\nTreezor → HTTP webhook → your backend\n\nIf process immediately:\n\n❌ DB down → webhook fails\n❌ service crash → event lost\n❌ slow processing → timeout → retries from Treezor → duplicates\n\n---\n\n⚙️ 2. Fan-out (multiple internal systems)\n\nOne Treezor event must feed multiple systems:\n\nledger-service (money truth)\nfraud detection\nnotifications\nanalytics\nreconciliation\n\n👉 Without Kafka:\n\nwebhook must call all services ❌ (bad coupling)\n\n👉 With Kafka:\n\npublish once\nmany consumers independently react\n\n---\n\n🧠 3. Buffering / load protection\n\nPayments are bursty (lunch time spikes, etc.)\n\nKafka acts as:\n\n👉 a shock absorber\n\nIf:\n\n10k events arrive in 1 sec\n\nKafka:\n\nstores them safely\nconsumers process at their own pace\n\n---\n\n🔁 4. Retry + replay (critical in fintech)\n\nIf ledger-service bug happens:\n\n👉 Can replay Kafka topic\n\nWithout Kafka:\n\nNeed to re-hit Treezor APIs (often impossible)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
